      'A caregiver history that is absent, inconsistent, evolving between tellings, or otherwise does not adequately explain the severity of findings',
      'An injury pattern inconsistent with the child\'s developmental/motor stage — for example, patterned or multiple bruises of different ages on a young infant who is not yet independently mobile',
      'Associated subdural hemorrhage (particularly interhemispheric) or other intracranial findings on neuroimaging obtained by the medical team',
